<title>UK: Autostrade sets 500 billion lire callable FRN.</title>
<headline>Autostrade sets 500 billion lire callable FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano (books) and Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CONCESSIONI E COSTRUZIONI STA (AUTOSTRADE)</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN ITL   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **06.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +20 BP    PAY DATE    06.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE ON INTEREST PAY DATE MAY 2000 AND 2001</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
